{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>They shall take their portion, etc.</b> The meaning: not that the authority should be in your hand and you should enter into a reckoning with them; rather, the authority is in their hand to take whatever they themselves deem proper, for it is they who are affected by it. In this too he showed him that, according to the truth, the possessions were relevant to them; but he was scrupulous about the statement, even though it is false, yet it nonetheless diminishes Abram's honor by his saying it."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:41:17.672189090Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}